<title>BRAZIL: RESEARCH ALERT - ING cuts Brazil power stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ING cuts Brazil power stocks.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings said it has downgraded its investment ratings on Sao Paulo power distributors Eletropaulo, LightPar and Cia Paulista de Forca e Luz.</p>
<p>-- ING analyst Charles Barnett said in a report the stocks have rallied sharply over the last two weeks, gaining between 15 percent and 28 percent in dollar terms.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Given these sharp increases, we believe a correction is likely this week,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
